#: ../../reference.rst:25
msgid ""
"Issues a stateless challenge: the requirement ticket from the challenged "
"response decides it, otherwise the reported URL is evaluated in normal "
"form (``414`` above 8 KiB, ``400`` for a path without a normal form). "
"Returns ``{id, algorithm, difficulty, challenges, expires_at}``"
